OL,3,GNEWSAFourth person charged in
OL,4,Aconnection with pro-Palestinian Action
OL,5,Arally
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman has been charged in connection
OL,8,Fwith a pro-Palestine Action rally in
OL,9,FEdinburgh.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to a demonstration
OL,12,Foutside the US Consulate building on
OL,13,FRegent Terrace on 31 October.
OL,15,FThe woman was charged with terrorism
OL,16,Foffences relating to "supporting a
OL,17,Fproscribed organisation". A report has
OL,18,Fbeen sent to the procurator fiscal.
OL,20,FTwo women and a man were previously
OL,21,Fcharged with the same offences relating
OL,22,Fto the protest.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
